AIserver Diffusers

Uses Hugging Face Diffusers MiniMax H3 modules under Apache License 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers
Pinned release: 0.41.0, upstream tag commit 086bf9578c0f4acbc66e48cd1e7cc26befd9e10f.

Independent compatibility adapters implement local checkpoint loading, AdaLN
curve interpolation, POWER9/V100 numerical handling and tensor parallelism.
